### Monitoreo de odómetro sin filtros (todas las unidades visibles) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Monitoreo de odómetro filtrado por unitId — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1
}

### Monitoreo de odómetro filtrado por privateCode — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "privateCode": "UNIT-GT-5001"
}

### Monitoreo de odómetro filtrado por nombre y deviceIdentifier — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitName": "Camion",
  "deviceIdentifier": "358000000000001"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 1
}

### Sin body (filters null) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Filtro con unidad inexistente (lista vacía, count 0) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Unit/monitoringOdometer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": 999999999
}
